    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Schnittger Bourne is pleased to bring Apartment 39, Orpen Hall, in the recently built Brennanstown Wood to the lettings market. \r\n\r\nA tastefully decorated two-bedroom property with private balcony, this superbly located apartment is set in a manicured development within walking distance of Foxrock village.\r\n\r\nIn turn key condition, the property boasts high-end finishes throughout, including top of the range integrated appliances and Silestone worktops.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises a bright hallway, kitchen, open-plan dining living room leading out to a private, sun-filled balcony, utility with built-in storage, master bedroom with en suite, guest double bedroom, main bathroom and additional closed storage.\r\n\r\nResidents have access to designated car parking, and residents enjoy exclusive use of a Ventura Design common room with kitchen and WC facilities.\r\n\r\nLocation:\r\n\r\nBrennanstown Wood was constructed in 2022 and is benefits from being within minutes of all local amenities. Along with being within walking distance of Foxrock, nearby villages also include Cabinteely, Cornelscourt, Deansgrange and Stillorgan.\r\n\r\nIt is well placed when it comes to transport, with easy access to the LUAS at Carrickmines, the M50, N11 and Dublin bus routes."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway - Long plank wood laminate flooring throughout, central ceiling lighting, console. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Living Room - Wood laminate flooring, floor to ceiling and eye level sleek navy cabinetry, integrated appliances including hob, single oven, dishwasher, undermounted sink, living space leads out to a private balcony, \r\n\r\nUtility - washing machine, built-in storage. \r\n\r\nMaster bedroom - Wood laminate flooring, built-in wardrobes, leads to en suite which is fully tiled, WC, shower, wash hand basin and vanity unit.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - Wood laminate flooring, built-in wardrobes. \r\n\r\nMain bathroom -  Fully tiled, WC, shower, wash hand basin and vanity unit."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "- Prime setting in a new development\r\n- Designated parking\r\n- Fully furnished & turn key condition\r\n- Close to all amenities"
      },
